{"presentation":{"slides":[{"elements":[{"x":77.33840378737209,"y":83.26303435934976,"width":19.605380403878875,"height":13.554029506202964,"goToSlide":1,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"next","invisible":false,"title":"weiter"}],"slideBackgroundSelector":{"imageSlideBackground":{"path":"images\/imageSlideBackground-68d0ded7f2707.jpg","mime":"image\/jpeg","copyright":{"license":"CC BY-SA","title":"Atlas F\u00fchrerschein Titel","author":"Digitalassistenz Sachsen-Anhalt","year":"2025","version":"4.0"},"width":1000,"height":563}}},{"elements":[{"x":5.555555555555555,"y":29.04865649963689,"width":90.41394335511983,"height":48.41442749939482,"action":{"library":"H5P.AdvancedText 1.1","params":{"text":"<p>Liebe Sch\u00fclerinnen und Sch\u00fcler,<\/p><p>dieser Kurs dient euch als Einf\u00fchrung in die&nbsp;<strong>Nutzung von Atlanten<\/strong>. Hier lernt ihr, welche Informationen ihr in einem Atlas findet und wie ihr ihn richtig benutzt. Au\u00dferdem k\u00f6nnt ihr euer erlerntes Wissen direkt in den anschlie\u00dfenden \u00dcbungen testen.<\/p><p>Am Ende gibt es einen Abschlusstest. Wenn ihr diesen erfolgreich besteht, erhaltet ihr ein&nbsp;<strong>Zertifikat f\u00fcr euren Atlasf\u00fchrerschein!<\/strong><\/p><p>Z\u00f6gert nicht, Fragen zu stellen oder Hilfe zu suchen, wenn ihr Unterst\u00fctzung ben\u00f6tigt.<\/p><p>Viel Erfolg und Freude beim Lernen!&nbsp;<\/p>"},"subContentId":"46081c73-71ff-4ccf-b151-0e531e3cd38e","metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Text unbenannt"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""},{"x":4.901960784313726,"y":83.27281529895909,"width":10.893246187363834,"height":7.746308399903171,"goToSlide":1,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"previous","invisible":false,"title":"zur\u00fcck"},{"x":84.31372549019608,"y":83.27281529895909,"width":10.893246187363834,"height":7.746308399903171,"goToSlide":1,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"next","invisible":false,"title":"weiter"}],"slideBackgroundSelector":{"imageSlideBackground":{"path":"images\/imageSlideBackground-685ba6905c8da.png","mime":"image\/png","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":1920,"height":1080}}},{"elements":[{"x":27.233115468409586,"y":19.365770999757927,"width":64.26677559912855,"height":50.35100459937061,"action":{"library":"H5P.AdvancedText 1.1","params":{"text":"<h3>Hinweise zur Nutzung<\/h3><p><span style=\"color:rgb(29,33,37);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">Bitte nutze f\u00fcr den Zugriff auf&nbsp;Moodle<\/span><strong> einen Webbrowser<\/strong><span style=\"color:rgb(29,33,37);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">&nbsp;(z. B. Mozilla Firefox).<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(29,33,37);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">Die&nbsp;<\/span><strong>Moodle-App stellt nicht alle Inhalte und Anwendungen korrekt dar<\/strong><span style=\"color:rgb(29,33,37);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">, sodass wir die App f\u00fcr diesen Kurs&nbsp;<\/span><strong>nicht empfehlen<\/strong><span style=\"color:rgb(29,33,37);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">.<\/span><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(29,33,37);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">Wir empfehlen, <\/span><strong>einen<\/strong><span style=\"color:rgb(29,33,37);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">&nbsp;<\/span><strong>PC, Laptop oder ein Tablet<\/strong><span style=\"color:rgb(29,33,37);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">&nbsp;zu verwenden. Die Nutzung \u00fcber&nbsp;<\/span><strong>ein Smartphone kann zu Schwierigkeiten mit der Bedienung und Darstellung f\u00fchren<\/strong><span style=\"color:rgb(29,33,37);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">. Solltest du dennoch ein Handy nutzen wollen, verwende es im Querformat.<\/span><\/p>"},"subContentId":"df688008-23ea-4eb7-8328-4d54742f0b8c","metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Text unbenannt"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""},{"x":83.87799564270152,"y":83.27281529895909,"width":11.567320261437908,"height":7.746308399903171,"goToSlide":1,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"next","invisible":false,"title":"weiter"},{"x":4.357298474945534,"y":83.27281529895909,"width":11.567320261437908,"height":7.746308399903171,"goToSlide":1,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"previous","invisible":false,"title":"zur\u00fcck"},{"x":2.178649237472767,"y":30.985233599612684,"width":21.611786276666884,"height":30.31653352699104,"action":{"library":"H5P.Image 1.1","params":{"decorative":true,"contentName":"Bild","expandImage":"Bild vergr\u00f6\u00dfern","minimizeImage":"Bild verkleinern","file":{"path":"images\/file-68d0df42798a5.jpg","mime":"image\/jpeg","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":1280,"height":1010}},"subContentId":"ab7d6b88-6115-4889-89df-a010d3c42198","metadata":{"contentType":"Image","license":"CC BY","title":"Laptop Notizbuch Rechner Klaviatur","authors":[{"name":"OpenClipart-Vectors","role":"Author"}],"licenseVersion":"4.0","source":"https:\/\/pixabay.com\/de\/vectors\/laptop-notizbuch-rechner-klaviatur-157424\/"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""},{"x":6.427015250544662,"y":32.728152989590896,"width":13.071895424836601,"height":14.829939481965626,"action":{"library":"H5P.Image 1.1","params":{"decorative":true,"contentName":"Bild","expandImage":"Bild vergr\u00f6\u00dfern","minimizeImage":"Bild verkleinern","file":{"path":"images\/file-6874d927070c9.png","mime":"image\/png","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":901,"height":575,"originalImage":{"path":"images\/file-6874d8c415